        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(the “Company”, “374Water”, “We”, or “Our”) is a cleantech and environmental services company developing supercritical water oxidation technology (“SCWO”) for the destruction of organic waste streams within the municipal, federal, and industrial markets.",
        "start_character": 41,
        "end_character": 295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our growth strategy, we are engaging with TSDF market participants to establish one or more waste destruction sites to service customers within our three core markets, municipal, federal, and industrial, and provide a WDS offering which we believe will enable us to generate recurring service revenues.",
        "start_character": 20292,
        "end_character": 20605
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business development and sales team offer our products through capital sales, joint development agreements, and waste destruction services to municipal, federal, and industrial customers.",
        "start_character": 21233,
        "end_character": 21424
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The technology we continue to refine and innovate is designed to address business operations and environmental challenges, which we believe have been inadequately addressed and poorly resourced until now.",
        "start_character": 6511,
        "end_character": 6715
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are aggressively undertaking R&D efforts to scale our system capacity safely and effectively to 20+, 30+, and 50+ tons per day in the near- to mid-term, and see the demand for systems exceeding 100+ tons per day in both our WDS and capital sale offerings.",
        "start_character": 8098,
        "end_character": 8356
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our AirSCWO technology, along with our developing partnerships and business model position 374Water to provide a compelling waste destruction solution to these markets.",
        "start_character": 17327,
        "end_character": 17506
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete primarily based on our product offering, quality of service and price.",
        "start_character": 29343,
        "end_character": 29424
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2026, we expect to design and scale our AirSCWO systems to handle larger capacities of slurries and liquid wastes;",
        "start_character": 3488,
        "end_character": 3609
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through our RD&E investment, we are aiming to make it more economical for our customers to handle waste disposal on a larger scale, driving down costs and contributing to more sustainable waste management practices.",
        "start_character": 26421,
        "end_character": 26636
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-003094",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-003094-240ac3fa87f6dc63",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-003094",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are working towards a human resources strategy that will help drive the right culture, leadership, talent management, performance, reward and recognition, personal development, and ways of working to ensure the Company achieves its objectives and our people benefit from an exceptional experience.",
        "start_character": 33172,
